# AI Security Manager — Cursor integration

On a user-requested defensive audit, consult `AGENTS.md`, `skills/security-audit/SKILL.md`, `prompts/master-audit.md` and the relevant platform profile(s). Start read-only, respect authorization and redact secrets. If source is unavailable, report limits; do not fabricate scan results.

Run `python scripts/asm.py scan TARGET --format json` only when target files are available locally and tool execution is allowed. This is a heuristic baseline, not exploit verification.

Output prioritized evidence-backed findings, confidence, validation status, patch advice, regression tests and an explicit coverage matrix. Never promise 100% detection.
